		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.powermag.com/?p=271992</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Horizon Technology Finance Corp., an affiliate of Monroe Capital, on September 10 said that the RoHo Capital Opportunity Fund LLC, a joint venture formed by Horizon and CR Financial Holdings, Inc., the holding company for Roth Capital Partners, LLC, has provided a $20-million senior credit facility to NeoVolta, Inc., with the ability to increase the facility to $30 million upon mutual agreement. An initial $20 million was funded at closing to support NeoVolta’s continued growth.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.powermag.com/battery-energy-storage-group-receives-millions-in-funding/">Battery Energy Storage Group Receives Millions in Funding</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.powermag.com">POWER Magazine</a>.</p>
<p><img width="500" height="400" src="https://www.powermag.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/neovolta.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="NeoVolta" decoding="async" srcset="https://www.powermag.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/neovolta.png 500w, https://www.powermag.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/neovolta-300x240.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></p>]]></description>
		
